> more people than all the earth-like planetary surfaces in the galaxy
> (in the story).
 
Sorry Hal, but the same matter in that spaceship, if used instead to build a
VR system, could house many orders more intelligences than in it's original
form.
 
BTW, if aliens have uploaded us, reincarnation could be used whenever we
"die."

